; The @1js FluentAI packages (@1js/fluentai, @1js/fai-react-chat-input) and the
; specific @fluentui builds they pin to are published to the 1JS Azure Artifacts
; feed (office/Office project). Per the FAI setup docs this feed is the DEFAULT
; registry - it upstreams public npm and also hosts the newer Fluent builds the
; @1js packages depend on. Keep this project file token-free: the Azure
; Artifacts credential provider resolves auth dynamically, or the build scripts
; pass PAT-backed endpoint JSON via the documented provider environment vars.
registry=https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/office/Office/_packaging/1JS/npm/registry/
always-auth=true
